e 1.$\n\n- Statement $Q$ is *true.* Indeed, ${3}^{2}=9.$\n\n- Statement $R$ is *true.* Indeed, $8$ is a composite number.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$P$ only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559776 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054818 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "228b0a63-bf0e-57bf-aa1e-ef5518236462" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Mathematical Statements"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00c6db1d-5927-5c6a-9a41-4fbc644fc1e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$Q$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559015} {:answer/id #uuid "1683e4df-7ac1-56de-93fe-3dc1c97b033d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$P$ and $Q$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559065} {:answer/id #uuid "d1a4ddc1-38ac-5eaa-ada1-0c765f9e51ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$Q$ and $R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559530} {:answer/id #uuid "d9dfa505-d63e-5fd7-9564-b821a3bed62f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559552} {:answer/id #uuid "f94e743c-7b96-5495-994f-6c9dca697862" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$P$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559629}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1683e4df-7ac1-56de-93fe-3dc1c97b033d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$P$ and $Q$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559065} :answer-field/id #uuid "599cb91c-0d63-5d51-9b83-794e5c17ff8e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559696}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0ac2c565-7f72-5deb-8186-0f592c4c5383" :question/math-academy-id "q-174379" :question/problem "Which of the following are mathematical statements?\n\n- $P:$ $0.5$ is a rational number.\n\n- $Q:$ $0.5$ is an irrational number.\n\n- $R:$ Divide $5$ by $10.$" :question/worked-solution "A mathematical statement is a sentence or mathematical expression that is either true or false.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options:\n\n- $P$ is a statement. This statement is *true* because $0.5=\\frac{5}{10},$ so it is a rational number.\n\n- $Q$ is a statement. This statement is *false* because $0.5$ is a rational number.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a statement because it is neither true nor false. Rather, it is an instruction.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$P$ and $Q$ only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559775 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054819 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4eda1965-d655-5550-9bb5-13e7a9c1b406" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Statements Expressed Using Symbols"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ea61359-4851-516b-b2a3-c6c648515cbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$Q$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559218} {:answer/id #uuid "73f80b23-1966-55fe-99ec-3a0c34dff20d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$P$  only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559308} {:answer/id #uuid "b9bd5ee1-380b-5707-9141-9827a7e72d0b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$Q$ and $R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559478} {:answer/id #uuid "c93f27ca-d6ca-5413-98d4-27b595552a02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559506} {:answer/id #uuid "d1069563-eea1-5f35-b63b-584fe5edde86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$P$ and $R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559525}] :answer-field/correct {:an